WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.720
F5.1 · From a file to a feed

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.654
You set up your practice company with files, by hand.

3
00:00:08.704 --> 00:00:12.551
That is the quick way to start. It is not how a client runs.

4
00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:16.023
Data reaches K-φ four ways.

5
00:00:16.074 --> 00:00:19.906
A connector first, then an endpoint, then a synced Google Sheet.

6
00:00:19.956 --> 00:00:22.420
A file by hand only for a one-off.

7
00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:30.639
Every route lands through the same checks: the ingest contract.

8
00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:34.593
The same line sent twice is replaced, never added twice.

9
00:00:35.743 --> 00:00:37.715
The test of a set-up is simple.

10
00:00:37.765 --> 00:00:40.962
At the next month end, does anyone have to do anything?

11
00:00:45.043 --> 00:00:49.288
Next: F5.2  The Copilot's connection assistant

